[SLICE]
UID: SLICE-WORKFLOW-DSL
TITLE: Design the workflow DSL: pick a shape, settle the condition language, then build
DEPTH: sketch
AUTHORED_BY: llm
STATEMENT: >>>
Design the DSL above the hook layer: rule DEC-DSL-SHAPE and
DEC-DSL-LAYER-COUNT, settle the condition language, then build the option
surface so that it compiles into MECH-HOOK-MIDDLEWARE-INTERFACE entries. Read
as WORK under DEC-SLICE-DECOMPOSES-TO-WORK; the prefix is the grammar's.
<<<
